sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant WM as WorkManager
    participant OS as OS (Doze/Standby)
    participant Net as Backend

    App->>WM: enqueue periodic sync (unmetered + charging)
    WM->>OS: register job with constraints
    Note over OS: device idle -> deep Doze. job deferred to next maintenance window
    OS->>WM: maintenance window + constraints met
    WM->>Net: delta sync (Ch 32)
    Net-->>WM: changes
    WM-->>App: updated (SSOT, Ch 3)
    Note over OS: outside window network suspended. work waits, no battery cost
